{"analytics_identifier":null,"base_path":"/government/news/fcdo-statement-un-integrated-food-security-phase-classification-snapshot-for-gaza","content_id":"68b0d636-2323-4cbe-94cf-b36912b16fd9","description":"FCDO statement on the UN’s Integrated Food Security Phase Classification (IPC) snapshot for Gaza","details":{"attachments":[],"body":"<div class=\"govspeak\"><h4 id=\"an-fcdo-spokesperson-said\">An FCDO spokesperson said:</h4>\n<blockquote>\n\n  <p>This UN Integrated Food Security Phase Classification report shows that Gaza continues to face crisis levels of food insecurity, which are only projected to deteriorate.</p>\n\n  <p>It is completely unacceptable that 1.2 million people are facing significant food shortages, with 90% of the population confined to around 30% of the Gaza Strip. Averting famine cannot be the benchmark for success. </p>\n\n  <p class=\"last-child\">Israeli restrictions on aid and repeated displacement are driving disease, water scarcity and decimating health services. Humanitarian aid must never be used as a political tool. The UK will continue to support humanitarian organisations working on the ground and press Israel to enable aid and commercial goods to enter Gaza at the scale needed.</p>\n\n</blockquote>\n\n<div class=\"address\"><div class=\"adr org fn\"><p>\nMedia enquiries<br><br>Email <a href=\"mailto:newsdesk@fcdo.gov.uk\">newsdesk@fcdo.gov.uk</a><br><br>Telephone 020 7008 3100<br><br>Email the FCDO Newsdesk (monitored 24 hours a day) in the first instance, and we will respond as soon as possible.\n</p></div></div>\n</div>","change_history":[{"note":"First published.","public_timestamp":"2026-07-23T19:24:00Z"}],"emphasised_organisations":["f9fcf3fe-2751-4dca-97ca-becaeceb4b26"],"images":[{"caption":null,"content_type":"image/jpeg","sources":{"s216":"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/621e4de5d3bf7f4f0b29b67c/s216_fcdo-main-building.jpg","s300":"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/621e4de48fa8f5490aff83b4/s300_fcdo-main-building.jpg","s465":"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/621e4de48fa8f549069a6616/s465_fcdo-main-building.jpg","s630":"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/621e4de4d3bf7f4f0743dc7c/s630_fcdo-main-building.jpg","s712":"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/621e4de4e90e0710acb2557a/s712_fcdo-main-building.jpg","s960":"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/621e4de4e90e0710be0354d7/s960_fcdo-main-building.jpg"},"type":"lead"}],"political":true},"document_type":"press_release","first_published_at":"2026-07-23T20:24:00+01:00","links":{"available_translations":[{"api_path":"/api/content/government/news/fcdo-statement-un-integrated-food-security-phase-classification-snapshot-for-gaza.ar","api_url":"https://www.gov.uk/api/content/government/news/fcdo-statement-un-integrated-food-security-phase-classification-snapshot-for-gaza.ar","base_path":"/government/news/fcdo-statement-un-integrated-food-security-phase-classification-snapshot-for-gaza.ar","content_id":"68b0d636-2323-4cbe-94cf-b36912b16fd9","document_type":"press_release","links":{},"locale":"ar","public_updated_at":"2026-07-23T19:24:00Z","schema_name":"news_article","title":"بيان حول تقرير التصنيف المتكامل لمراحل الأمن الغذائي الصادر عن الأمم المتحدة ","web_url":"https://www.gov.uk/government/news/fcdo-statement-un-integrated-food-security-phase-classification-snapshot-for-gaza.ar","withdrawn":false},{"api_path":"/api/content/government/news/fcdo-statement-un-integrated-food-security-phase-classification-snapshot-for-gaza","api_url":"https://www.gov.uk/api/content/government/news/fcdo-statement-un-integrated-food-security-phase-classification-snapshot-for-gaza","base_path":"/government/news/fcdo-statement-un-integrated-food-security-phase-classification-snapshot-for-gaza","content_id":"68b0d636-2323-4cbe-94cf-b36912b16fd9","document_type":"press_release","links":{},"locale":"en","public_updated_at":"2026-07-23T19:24:00Z","schema_name":"news_article","title":"FCDO sta